  "description": "YOBGOP crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21. Reported CIF formula moiety: C102 H96 Dy4 F6 N6 O20,3(C2 H3 N1),2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.499-3.913 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.03-111.92°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C108H109N9O22F6Dy4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
